Scripts and data to reproduce 'Vertical kinship distribution at the population level: a Mamushka approximation':
- "nac_estimates.R" all national results can be reproduced.
- "prov_estimates.R" generates results for provinces (some data is downloadable online)
- "microsim.R" makes the microsimulation test, comparing with momushka results.
- "run_sweden_1970_2017_with_death.R" compares time-varying scenario against Sweden in 2017. 
